 r←Test_YesNoCancel_001(stopFlag batchFlag);myGuiParms;msg;parms;result;⎕TRAP
⍝ Exercise "YesNoCancel" with a question spanning several lines and "Cancel" as default button.
 r←T._Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 myGuiParms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 myGuiParms.regKey←'MyApp\Kai1'
 myGuiParms.icon←⎕NEW'Icon'(⊂'File'(GetFile'Sample.ico'))
 myGuiParms.testMode←1

 msg←'Are you really sure about this?' '' 'This does not look right.'
 msg,←'In fact I think it is total rubbish.' 'I have never seen something similarly stupid.'
 msg,←'' 'I suggest you reconsider your decision.'
 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Dialogs.CreateParmsForYesNoCancel
 parms.addToCaption←'My caption'
 parms.style←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Enums.DialogStyles.Error
 parms.timeout←0.1
 parms.autoPress←2
 result←parms myGuiParms #.APLGUI.APLGUI.Dialogs.YesNoCancel msg
 →T.FailsIf ¯1≠result

 r←T._OK
